?doklad:exit
?p1post and p2post and p3post and p4post:goto "dokl"
hintC "只有当四个哨所的哨兵全部换成了你们班的战士，你们才能报告换岗完毕"
exit

#dokl
doklad = true
Up say "doklad1"
~2.5
Ofser say "doklad2"
hintC "要确认你们的哨兵还活着、没有打瞌睡，请按 ~ - 5 - 5。他们会依次报告自身状态。"
"0" objstatus "DONE"
"1" objstatus "DONE"
"2" objstatus "DONE"
"3" objstatus "DONE"
"4" objstatus "DONE"
1 setRadioMsg "警报！"
~3
exit
